代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8"]},"ordering_evidence":"gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8","source_order":[8,51,117],"order":1941},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o007b","title":"公孙瓒表刘备为别部司马助田楷","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o007b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"公孙瓒表刘备为别部司马，使其助田楷抵御袁绍；刘备屡有战功，试守平原令，后领平原相。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o007b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0093","role":"表荐","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o007b-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"领兵任官","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o007b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0017","role":"率部拒袁","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o007b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"平原","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o007b-q"]},"time":{"label":"投奔公孙瓒后","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o007b-q"],"after":"xianzhu-e-o007a"},"source_order":[32,22,"O007b"],"order":6502},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o008a","title":"刘备田楷屯齐并救陶谦","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o008a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"袁绍攻公孙瓒，刘备与田楷东屯齐；曹操攻徐州时，二人应陶谦求救前往。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o008a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"屯齐赴援","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o008a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0017","role":"赴援","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o008a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0095","role":"求援","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o008a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"征徐州","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o008a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"齐、徐州","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o008a-q"]},"time":{"label":"曹操征徐州时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o008a-q"]},"source_order":[32,39,"O008a"],"order":6508}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0017","name":"田楷","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o007","guanzhang-q-o041","dongyuan-q-p075","gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8","gongsuntao-q-f147dfe88cb7427b4e5c"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o007-xianzhu-p0017","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o007"]},{"id":"xianzhu-m-o008-xianzhu-p0017","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o008"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-o041-xianzhu-p0017","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-o041"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p075-xianzhu-p0017","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p075"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-1de5e722305538876918","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-591fa63689368e8ab703","layer":"pei","quote":"遂为袁谭所攻，自春至夏，城小寇众，流矢雨集。然融凭几安坐，读书论议自若","attribution":"裴注·《九州春秋》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0ed74dd0dffffddb82dc","start":513,"end":548,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e8d4ee5b2ff8191edb22","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-591fa63689368e8ab703","layer":"pei","quote":"城坏众亡，身奔山东；室家为谭所虏","attribution":"裴注·《九州春秋》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0ed74dd0dffffddb82dc","start":549,"end":565,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p075b-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-f39003f8dec6806c0da9","layer":"pei","quote":"谭始至青州，为都督，未为刺史；后太祖拜为刺史。其土自河而西，盖不过平原而已。遂北排田楷，东攻孔融，曜兵海隅。是时百姓无主，欣戴之矣。","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-06a13297a618ccaa32fd","start":113,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p075","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-f39003f8dec6806c0da9","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《九州春秋》载：“授谏辞曰：‘世称一兔走衢，万人逐之；一人获之，贪者悉止：分定故也。且年均以贤，德均则卜，古之制也。愿上惟先代成败之戒，下思逐兔分定之义。’绍曰：‘孤欲令四儿各据一州，以观其能。’授出曰：‘祸其始此乎？’谭始至青州，为都督，未为刺史；后太祖拜为刺史。其土自河而西，盖不过平原而已。遂北排田楷，东攻孔融，曜兵海隅。是时百姓无主，欣戴之矣。然信用群小，好受近言；肆志奢淫，不知稼穑之艰难。华彦、孔顺，皆奸佞小人也，信以为腹心；王修等备官而已。然能接待宾客，慕名敬士。使妇弟领兵在内，至令草窃市井而外，虏掠田野。别使两将募兵下县，有赂者见免，无者见取；贫弱者多，乃至于窜伏丘野之中，放兵捕索，如猎鸟兽。邑有万户者，著籍不盈数百；收赋纳税，三分不入一。招命贤士，不就；不趋赴军期，安居族党，亦不能罪也。”","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-06a13297a618ccaa32fd","start":0,"end":359,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-57a797d4345ff3aedfc8","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-b2ad847988834f852565","layer":"original","quote":"兵益盛，进军界桥〖9〗。﹝二﹞以严纲为冀州〖10〗，田楷为青州，单经为兖州，置诸郡县","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":117,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-5a872d064dcb5abaf09c","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-d62dba1d26dbc118a0ed","layer":"original","quote":"初平四年，太祖征谦。攻拔十余城，至彭城，大战。谦兵败走，死者万数，泗水为之不流〖7〗。谦退守郯，太祖以粮少，引军还","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-f147dfe88cb7427b4e5c","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-b003f52427451302a092","layer":"pei","quote":"曹公得谦上事，知不罢兵。乃进攻彭城，多杀人民。谦引兵击之，青州刺史田楷亦以兵救谦。公引兵还","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":140,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-df575ef0b922cb13c6c5","start":636,"end":681,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o041","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-0115adad8a91126b45f3","layer":"original","quote":"赵云字子龙，常山真定人也〖1〗。本属公孙瓒；瓒遣先主为田楷拒袁绍〖2〗，云遂随从，为先主主骑〖3〗。﹝一﹞及先主为曹公所追于当阳长坂，弃妻子南走。云身抱弱子，即后主也；保护甘夫人，即后主母也：皆得免难。迁为牙门将军〖4〗。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o026a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5dfff8df0932ae2bd730","layer":"original","quote":"秋，太祖征陶谦，下十余城。谦守城不敢出。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：初平四年（公元 193）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c3dba248d94a4751844d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o024","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c2e697c9981c6cd8d3e8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，军鄄城〖2〗。荆州牧刘表断术粮道〖3〗。术引军入陈留，屯封丘〖4〗；黑山余贼及于夫罗等佐之。术使将刘详屯匡亭〖5〗。太祖击详，术救之；与战，大破之。术退保封丘，遂围之；未合，术走襄邑〖6〗。追到太寿〖7〗，决渠水灌城；走宁陵〖8〗。又追之，走九江〖9〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o007b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-7cab87f85bc6fc204329","layer":"original","quote":"瓒表为别部司马，使为青州刺史田楷〖7〗，以拒冀州牧袁绍。数有战功，试守平原令〖8〗。后领平原相；","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o008a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-896d9587cf6b9dcbaff8","layer":"original","quote":"袁绍攻公孙瓒，先主与田楷东屯齐。曹公征徐州，徐州牧陶谦遣使告急于田楷；楷与先主俱救之。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o007","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-7cab87f85bc6fc204329","layer":"original","quote":"后为高唐尉，迁为令。﹝四﹞为贼所破，往奔中郎将公孙瓒。瓒表为别部司马，使为青州刺史田楷〖7〗，以拒冀州牧袁绍。数有战功，试守平原令〖8〗。后领平原相；郡民刘平，素轻先主，耻为之下，使客刺之；客不忍刺，语之而去〖9〗。其得人心如此。﹝五﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o008","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-896d9587cf6b9dcbaff8","layer":"original","quote":"袁绍攻公孙瓒，先主与田楷东屯齐。曹公征徐州，徐州牧陶谦遣使告急于田楷；楷与先主俱救之。时先主自有兵千余人及幽州乌丸杂胡骑，又略得饥民数千人。既到，谦以丹杨兵四千，益先主〖1〗；先主遂去楷，归谦。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
